- id: request-required-property-became-read-only
  text: 'the request required property `allOf[subschema #3]/릇䍱琨압蝪颯` became read-only'
  comment: This is a warning because a read-only property should not be sent in a request, and the specification leaves it to the server whether to ignore it or reject the request. Clients that send it may be rejected, or find the value they send is no longer used. This compared the `allOf` branches one at a time, so another branch may already describe what changed here, leaving the merged schema the same. Run with --flatten-allof to merge the branches and compare what they describe together.
  disclaimers:
    - all-of-not-flattened
  level: 2
  operation: PATCH
  operationId: patch_pets_{petId}
  path: /pets/{petId}
  section: paths
